74577 1017 #edb/ref 17592186374578 13194139535923 true] [17592186374577 1089 "q-120285" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374577 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535923 true] [17592186374577 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072133/assets/c4d26b3db6446f586ca47634d9f9a3a004968a0081b8859ce46b4b4af799d066.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OH}=h,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OI}=i$ and $J$ divides $\\overset{―}{HI}$ in the ratio $HJ:JI=3:7.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{OJ}.$" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374577 1113 #uuid "94886abc-d5f4-549c-88a5-0c9095cd6221" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374577 1145 "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\overset{\\to }{OH}+\\overset{\\to }{HJ}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OH}=h,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{HJ}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OHI,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{HI} & =\\overset{\\to }{HO}+\\overset{\\to }{OI} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OH}+\\overset{\\to }{OI} \\\\  & =-h+i \\\\  & =i-h.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $HJ:JI=3:7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{HJ}=\\frac{3}{10}\\overset{\\to }{HI}=\\frac{3}{10}(i-h).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OJ} & =\\overset{\\to }{OH}+\\overset{\\to }{HJ} \\\\  & =h+\\frac{3}{10}(i-h) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{10}h+\\frac{3}{10}i.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374579 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374580 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374581 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374582 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374583 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1041 "selection" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1104 #edb/ref 17592186374583 13194139535923 true] [17592186374578 1110 #uuid "119c1703-b739-5d7d-ac80-fd52c955b62b" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374579 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{3}{10}h+\\frac{7}{10}i" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374579 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535923 true] [17592186374579 1111 #uuid "2cfa1f55-551a-5306-bd99-fea04c91ec1e" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374580 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{1}{2}h+\\frac{1}{2}i" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374580 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535923 true] [17592186374580 1111 #uuid "3be49e71-5568-5d62-82d7-e93c7a49c9de" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374581 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{2}{5}h+\\frac{3}{5}i" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374581 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535923 true] [17592186374581 1111 #uuid "34231eb7-95de-578d-b6fb-bea5404c4896" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374582 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{3}{5}h+\\frac{2}{5}i" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374582 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535923 true] [17592186374582 1111 #uuid "9b15f0ef-62bd-5bf4-b839-6eaeb395f1ae" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374583 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OJ}=\\frac{7}{10}h+\\frac{3}{10}i" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374583 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535923 true] [17592186374583 1111 #uuid "90fd9287-b4a0-5691-951e-3bfea08cd342" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374584 1017 #edb/ref 17592186374585 13194139535923 true] [17592186374584 1089 "q-325974" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374584 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535923 true] [17592186374584 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14072133/assets/bae20e625c529ef2157faa4d534a19529c605c9002ed750e56723ff29e265226.png)\n\nConsider the picture above. If $c=\\lambda a-4b,$ then\n\n$\\lambda =$\n{{field-1}}." 13194139535923 true] [17592186374584 1113 #uuid "d8a903e8-340b-59c1-b98b-e4da25996e2e" 13194139535923 true] [17592186374584 1145 "To find $\\lambda ,$ we want to match the expression\n\n$$\nc=\\lambda a-4b.\n$$\n\nWe are given that one of the component